{#- Jin ages ka kam se kam ek set live hai (owner, 2026-11-27).
    /quizzes/mcq/ ke age cards ke liye. assets/mcq.js me LIVE_AGES ek haath se likhi list hai aur
    catalogAges() database se login sets dekhta hai — par ek FREE set sirf ek file hoti hai, database me
    uska koi row nahi. Isliye build yahan likh deta hai ki kis age ka koi set live hai, aur mcq.js use
    padh kar us age ka card khol deta hai. Matlab /admin/upload-mcq/ se chadha free set apne age ka card
    bhi khud khol dega — koi slug haath se nahi daalna padta. -#}
{% set slugs = [] -%}
{%- for age in mcqAges -%}
{%- if age.hasLive -%}{% set slugs = (slugs.push(age.slug), slugs) %}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ slugs | dump | safe }}
